# Measured peaks (docs/RAM_BUDGET.md, 2026-11-06). Scheduler inputs; re-measure with tools/measure-ram.sh.
# HEAVY = max measured whole-cgroup peak (nextest-full 3972 MiB) rounded up to 4 GiB (owner 2026-11-06 08:05: 2 slots).
# E2E (unmeasured) runs exclusive (both slots) via sched.sh until its peak is measured.
PEAK_HEAVY_MIB=4096
PEAK_LIGHT_MIB=1024
